   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## How to use - tested on RTX 3060 12 GB\n\n1. Load your picture in **Load Image**.\n2. Say what to change in the edit prompt: \"change only the jacket to a black wool coat\".\n3. Press **Run**. The edit LoRA does the work; output size follows your image (about 1 MP).\n\nRTX 3060, 1 MP: 1 min 11 s.\n\nCompare Images shows before and after."
   ],
